telcochisel-metapackages (2026.3.1-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Honest tier contents: the 2g-3g/4g/5g/sim/ue tiers previously named tools
    (srsRAN, Open5GS, UERANSIM, 5Ghoul, pySim, FirmWire, ...) that are not
    Ubuntu packages, so `apt install` did not deliver them. Descriptions now
    state what APT installs (SDR/hardware access, build tooling, telcosec-cli,
    APT-available tools) vs. what builds on first run via the *-install helpers.
  * Those tiers now Depend on telcosec-cli + build-essential/cmake/git so the
    first-run installers actually work on a plain Ubuntu enrollment.

 -- TelcoChisel Engineering Team <ops@telcochisel.com>  Sun, 19 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0000

